        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "The **Racine September manufacturing order MO-25-09-1070** is work order **WO-2025-09-004**. Its component-issue source transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070** (cost event **CE-250904-0004**) is recorded at **$318,250.75** (**31,825,075 cents**).\n\n- **Event created:** 2025-09-30 20:25:00  \n- **September period entered Pending Close:** 2025-09-30 18:00:00  \n- **Lateness:** 145 minutes  \n- **Recorded accounting status:** POSTED  \n\n**Conclusion:** The POSTED status is **not consistent** with the supplied Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B policy. It says newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged for Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting until the period is closed or reopened. The event was created after Pending Close, though its event date is September 30.\n\nThe review was read-only; no database records were changed. The report was submitted and verified.",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer"
